---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Booking terms | One Happy Picnic Aruba" description="Booking, payment, cancellation and weather terms for One Happy Picnic Aruba beach picnics.">
<div class="page">
  <div class="container page__inner">
    <h1>Booking terms</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated October 14, 2026</p>
    <p>These terms apply to every picnic, proposal setup and charcuterie order with One Happy Picnic Aruba.</p>
    <h2>Your booking</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A request sent through this website is not a confirmed booking. Your date is confirmed once we reply and you complete payment.</li>
      <li>Picnics last two hours unless we agree on extra time.</li>
      <li>We send you a map pin of your setup before the picnic. Please arrive on time, as the end time does not move for late arrivals.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cancellations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cancel up to 24 hours before your picnic for a full refund.</li>
      <li>Cancellations within 24 hours of the picnic, no shows and late arrivals are not refunded.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Weather</h2>
    <p>If rain or strong wind makes your picnic unsafe or impossible, we offer a new date or a full refund. Short showers that pass before your start time are not a reason to cancel on either side.</p>
    <h2>Food and allergies</h2>
    <p>Tell us about allergies and dietary needs when you book. We do our best to adapt the menu, but our kitchen handles nuts, dairy and gluten.</p>
    <h2>Care of the setup</h2>
    <p>Decor, tableware and textiles belong to One Happy Picnic Aruba. Items that are damaged or missing at the end of a picnic may be charged at replacement cost.</p>
    <h2>Beach rules</h2>
    <p>We hold the beach permit for your setup. Please follow local beach rules and keep glass on the table.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
